# Density Compare
# Sulfur (S) — real density 2.07 g/cm³. equal masses: Sulfur vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Sulfur Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 15.7mm color: #ffff30 at (-20mm, 7.8mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 16.5 g — the water cube is the reference
